<%# Ejected from the avo gem (bin/rails generate avo:eject --partial :head)
    -- deliberately empty by default in Avo itself, an extension point for
    exactly this: pulling in our own JS on top of Avo's own admin panel.
    See app/javascript/avo.custom.js. %>
<%= javascript_importmap_tags "avo.custom" %>

<%# poster.css is small and scoped under .poster-* (see that file's own
    header comment) -- safe to load on every Avo page rather than plumbing
    a per-page content_for through Avo's own layout, which doesn't yield
    one here. Phase 11 (poster generator). %>
<%= stylesheet_link_tag "poster" %>
